<title>UK: RESEARCH ALERT-Telefonica upped to &quot;buy&quot; at Lehman.</title>
<headline>RESEARCH ALERT-Telefonica upped to &quot;buy&quot; at Lehman.</headline>
<dateline>LONDON 1997-06-17</dateline>
<text>
<p>Lehman Brothers said on Tuesday it upgraded Spanish Telefonica de Espana from &quot;outperform&quot; to &quot;buy&quot;.</p>
<p>Telefonica now looked the best stock in the fixed line sector, Lehman said in its research alert.  </p>
<p>Growth in the fixed line telephone business in Spain was the highest in the telecommunications sectors while damages from competing companies should remain below the average in Europe, Lehman said.</p>
<p>By 0930 GMT the stock was up 15 pesetas to 4,340 pesetas.</p>
<p>-- London Newsroom, +44 171 542 7717</p>
</text>
